{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625077881,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_Du5FwP2XbHMVUe5Hhs5KPOzl","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tsconfig.tests.json","offset":1,"limit":180},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tsconfig.tests.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   // Test files are excluded from the build config, and the typecheck lane runs\n3:   // against that same config, so nothing has ever type-checked them. A symbol a\n4:   // test references but never imports is therefore invisible until the file runs,\n5:   // and a module-load failure reports as a failed file that collected no tests,\n6:   // which reads as red rather than as absent coverage.\n7:   //\n8:   // This config exists to make that class visible. It is reported, not enforced:\n9:   // the tree does not pass yet, and turning it into a blocker before the backlog\n10:   // is cleared would only teach people to skip it.\n11:   \"extends\": \"./tsconfig.json\",\n12:   \"compilerOptions\": {\n13:     \"noEmit\": true,\n14:     \"composite\": false,\n15:     \"types\": [\"node\"],\n16:     // Vitest resolves these files itself, so the build's module and strictness\n17:     // settings describe a compilation that never happens. Matching the runtime\n18:     // keeps this lane reporting symbols that genuinely do not exist rather than\n19:     // thousands of findings about a build nobody runs.\n20:     \"module\": \"esnext\",\n21:     \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n22:     \"noImplicitAny\": false,\n23:     \"noUnusedLocals\": false,\n24:     \"noUnusedParameters\": false,\n25:     \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true\n26:   },\n27:   \"include\": [\n28:     \"tests/**/*.ts\",\n29:     \"lib/test-helpers/**/*.ts\"\n30:   ],\n31:   \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"cli/**\"]\n32: }\n\n(End of file - total 32 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  // Test files are excluded from the build config, and the typecheck lane runs\n  // against that same config, so nothing has ever type-checked them. A symbol a\n  // test references but never imports is therefore invisible until the file runs,\n  // and a module-load failure reports as a failed file that collected no tests,\n  // which reads as red rather than as absent coverage.\n  //\n  // This config exists to make that class visible. It is reported, not enforced:\n  // the tree does not pass yet, and turning it into a blocker before the backlog\n  // is cleared would only teach people to skip it.\n  \"extends\": \"./tsconfig.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"composite\": false,\n    \"types\": [\"node\"],\n    // Vitest resolves these files itself, so the build's module and strictness\n    // settings describe a compilation that never happens. Matching the runtime\n    // keeps this lane reporting symbols that genuinely do not exist rather than\n    // thousands of findings about a build nobody runs.\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tsconfig.tests.json","text":"{\n  // Test files are excluded from the build config, and the typecheck lane runs\n  // against that same config, so nothing has ever type-checked them. A symbol a\n  // test references but never imports is therefore invisible until the file runs,\n  // and a module-load failure reports as a failed file that collected no tests,\n  // which reads as red rather than as absent coverage.\n  //\n  // This config exists to make that class visible. It is reported, not enforced:\n  // the tree does not pass yet, and turning it into a blocker before the backlog\n  // is cleared would only teach people to skip it.\n  \"extends\": \"./tsconfig.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"composite\": false,\n    \"types\": [\"node\"],\n    // Vitest resolves these files itself, so the build's module and strictness\n    // settings describe a compilation that never happens. Matching the runtime\n    // keeps this lane reporting symbols that genuinely do not exist rather than\n    // thousands of findings about a build nobody runs.\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"noImplicitAny\": false,\n    \"noUnusedLocals\": false,\n    \"noUnusedParameters\": false,\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\n    \"tests/**/*.ts\",\n    \"lib/test-helpers/**/*.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"cli/**\"]\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":32,"totalLines":32,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tsconfig.tests.json","time":{"start":1788625077864,"end":1788625077881}},"id":"prt_0725cc667001f6s72iIgbBIZ5q","sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","messageID":"msg_0725c7d24001gry4M3BG1tqqzc"}}
