{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625077887,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_i1Q8OuOpQuan7Odv5EJuUV0P","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"scripts/|memory/|runtime/runtime|runtime/cli","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli","include":"*.md"},"output":"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md:\n  Line 16: `scripts/validation/` contains focused validators used by the Spec Kit validation flow, the pre-commit gate and the write-time comment-hygiene hook. The scripts produce structured pass / warn / fail output that shell wrappers and strict validation gates consume.\n\n  Line 87: node .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/ephemeral-pointer-audit.mjs \\\n\n  Line 88:   .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli\n\n  Line 95: python3 .opencode/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/validate_document.py \\\n\n  Line 96:   .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md\n\n  Line 105: - [`scripts/`](../README.md)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/resource-map/README.md:\n  Line 9: `scripts/resource-map/` owns the CommonJS helper that turns deep review or deep research evidence into a `resource-map.md` ledger.\n\n  Line 28: scripts/resource-map/\n\n  Line 52: const { emitResourceMap } = require('./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/resource-map/extract-from-evidence.cjs')\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README-repair-derived.md:\n  Line 59: node .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/repair-derived.cjs --roots specs\n\n  Line 142: - `sk-doc/sk-create-skill/script