ncile checked claims with direct evidence. |\n71: | `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | 0 | Check catalog claims when the inspected surface applies. |\n72: | `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | 0 | Check executable operator instructions in scope. |\n73: \n74: ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n75: The bounded file inventory is `scratch/review-scope.txt`. Each iteration records the exact subset read.\n76: \n77: ## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n78: - Max iterations: 10\n79: - Convergence threshold: 3\n80: - Stop policy: max-iterations\n81: - Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-luna-max-review-5-1788624802460-meehmn, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n82: - Severity threshold: P2\n83: - Review target type: spec-folder\n84: - Artifact root: `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5`\n\n(End of file - total 84 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy\ndescription: Lineage-local review strategy for the scripts-to-runtime nesting packet.\nversion: 1.11.0.13\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\nThis strategy tracks ten inline passes. The requested `max-iterations` policy makes convergence telemetry only until iteration 10.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\nReview of `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting` and its bounded implementation and packet evidence.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deep-review-strategy.md","text":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy\ndescription: Lineage-local review strategy for the scripts-to-runtime nesting packet.\nversion: 1.11.0.13\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\nThis strategy tracks ten inline passes. The requested `max-iterations` policy makes convergence telemetry only until iteration 10.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\nReview of `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting` and its bounded implementation and packet evidence.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n- No source, target spec, generated repository artifact, git state, branch or external service changes.\n- No repository validation, build, install or test command that can write outside this lineage.\n- No resource-map coverage gate because no resource map existed at initialization.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\nRun all ten iterations. Convergence before iteration 10 is telemetry only. A pause, malformed state or write refusal would block the lineage.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| correctness | pending | 0 | Not started |\n| security | pending | 0 | Not started |\n| traceability | pending | 0 | Not started |\n| maintainability | pending | 0 | Not started |\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0 active\n- P1 (Required): 0 active\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0 active\n- Resolved: 0\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Direct source reads and exact path:line citations.\n- Separate review of executable paths, packet claims, registries and persistent documentation.\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- Coverage-graph mutation is unavailable under the lineage-only write surface. Graph status is recorded as unavailable.\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES\nNone yet.\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\nNone yet.\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\ncorrectness: workspace/package topology and executable entrypoints\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n- Target pointers: packet documents, `scratch/inventory.md`, `scratch/path-map.json`, `scratch/review-scope.txt`, package manifests, test configs and changed runtime consumers.\n- Behavior claims: the CLI moved to `runtime/cli/`; `runtime/scripts/` remains build tooling; `memory/` was renamed to `continuity/`; the packet claims completion and records remaining test limitations.\n- Reuse and conventions: root workspace metadata, runtime/cli package scripts, compiled `dist`, path maps, hook resolution and validation orchestration.\n- Risks and gaps: source and packet evidence may have drifted after earlier review passes; repository commands are intentionally not run in this detached lineage.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | 0 | Compare packet claims with current implementation. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | 0 | Reconcile checked claims with direct evidence. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | 0 | Check catalog claims when the inspected surface applies. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | 0 | Check executable operator instructions in scope. |\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\nThe bounded file inventory is `scratch/review-scope.txt`. Each iteration records the exact subset read.\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n- Max iterations: 10\n- Convergence threshold: 3\n- Stop policy: max-iterations\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-luna-max-review-5-1788624802460-meehmn, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Artifact root: `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5`","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":84,"totalLines":84,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deep-review-strategy.md","time":{"start":1788625324937,"end":1788625324949}},"id":"