{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625379077,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_0aqXmYZBg7cYLH86apOk5SJJ","state":{"status":"error","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-002.md\n+# Iteration 002: Security, Containment And Executable Selection\n+\n+## Focus\n+Review path normalization, symlink and prefix containment, explicit output handling and the stop-hook executable resolver.\n+\n+## Sources Reviewed\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/utils/path-utils.ts:23-92`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec-folder/generate-description.ts:87-105`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec-folder/directory-setup.ts:22-83`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/session-stop.ts:61-89,125-173`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scratch/execute-plan.md:151-164`\n+\n+## Findings\n+### P1, Security\n+- **F003**: `sanitizePath()` canonicalizes the candidate and each base independently, then applies relative containment. The direct path boundary is sound against traversal and prefix bypass on existing paths. Missing leaf paths are canonicalized through their parent, which preserves the containment check for the intended create/update callers.\n+\n+### P2, Maintainability\n+- **F004**: `generate-description.ts:90-105` and `path-utils.ts:37-52` duplicate realpath-and-boundary logic with different error/reporting behavior. The duplication is not a confirmed vulnerability, but future path changes can drift between the two consumers.\n+\n+## Cross-Reference Results\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|---|---|---|---|---|\n+| spec_code | pass | hard | `generate-description.ts:90-105`; `path-utils.ts:61-92` | Containment behavior matches the packet's path-security claim. |\n+| checklist_evidence | partial | hard | `spec.md:171-177`; `implementation-summary.md:208-230` | Direct code evidence exists; the command gate remains unexecuted. |\n+\n+## Assessment\n+- New findings ratio: 0.5\n+- Dimensions addressed: security, correctness\n+- Novelty justification: security review confirmed the main guards and admitted only a non-blocking duplicated seam.\n+\n+## Ruled Out\n+- Prefix bypass: ruled out by `path.relative()` boundary checks in both consumers.\n+- Production env redirection of the stop hook: ruled out because the explicit script override is accepted only in test mode at `session-stop.ts:61-77`.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Trace packet claims, inventory evidence, acceptance rows and generated metadata against the current implementation state.\n+\n+Review verdict: PASS\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"mode\":\"review\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"security:path-containment-and-hook-selection\",\"dimensions\":[\"security\",\"correctness\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/utils/path-utils.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec-folder/generate-description.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec-folder/directory-setup.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/session-stop.ts\",\"scratch/execute-plan.md\"],\"findingsCount\":4,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":3},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":1},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Path containment is directly evidenced but command replay remains unavailable\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"file\":\".opencode/skills/system-spec-ki