{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625437907,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_O6O1mqS0EqTqkzBxHkylBHrJ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-003.md\n+# Iteration 003: Traceability, Packet Truth And Acceptance Evidence\n+\n+## Focus\n+Compare the packet's scope, status, level, acceptance rows, inventory and implementation summary with the current implementation references.\n+\n+## Sources Reviewed\n+- `spec.md:19-32,40-50,64-110,118-143,148-177,202-210`\n+- `plan.md:22-33,40-48,53-84,98-116,121-145`\n+- `tasks.md:34-71,98-169`\n+- `acceptance-criteria.md:36-63,85-91`\n+- `implementation-summary.md:40-72,136-155,208-245,247-301,306-358`\n+- `scratch/inventory.md:18-45,226-251,330-376`\n+- `scratch/path-map.json:1-16,105-180`\n+\n+## Findings\n+### P1, Traceability\n+- **F005**: The packet's authored history remains contradictory. `spec.md:64-65` and `spec.md:80-83` describe planning-only scope and a future execution packet, while `plan.md:32` and `implementation-summary.md:55-72` state that the move executed in this folder. `acceptance-criteria.md:45-48` marks the packet complete. This is an active packet-truth defect even though the shipped implementation is now present.\n+\n+### P2, Traceability\n+- **F006**: The inventory and path map preserve historical pre-move recommendations such as keeping `@spec-kit/scripts` and referring to `scripts/package.json`, while the current package is `@spec-kit/cli` at `runtime/cli/package.json`. The documents label these as execution inputs, so the distinction between historical plan and current state is not consistently explicit.\n+\n+## Cross-Reference Results\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|---|---|---|---|---|\n+| spec_code | partial | hard | `spec.md:64-83`; `implementation-summary.md:55-72` | Implementation state is present, but authored scope still says the move is out of scope. |\n+| checklist_evidence | partial | hard | `acceptance-criteria.md:58-63`; `tasks.md:56-60` | Rows are marked complete, but packet state needs reconciliation. |\n+| feature_catalog_code | pass | advisory | `implementation-summary.md:136-155` | Current implementation summary names the moved surfaces. |\n+| playbook_capability | partial | advisory | `scratch/execute-plan.md:141-164` | Handoff still contains historical execution framing. |\n+\n+## Assessment\n+- New findings ratio: 0.75\n+- Dimensions addressed: traceability\n+- Novelty justification: this pass distinguishes current implementation correctness from packet-document truthfulness.\n+\n+## Ruled Out\n+- Missing target-layout decision: ruled out by `spec.md:74-77` and `scratch/inventory.md:18-36`.\n+- Missing inventory: ruled out by `scratch/inventory.md:38-376` and `scratch/review-scope.txt`.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Review persistent CLI documentation, catalogs and operator instructions for stale topology or retired folder links.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"mode\":\"review\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"traceability:packet-truth-and-acceptance-evidence\",\"dimensions\":[\"traceability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\"spec.md\",\"plan.md\",\"tasks.md\",\"acceptance-criteria.md\",\"implementation-summary.md\",\"scratch/inventory.md\",\"scratch/path-map.json\"],\"findingsCount\":6,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":3,\"P2\":3},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":1},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Packet scope and completion state remain contradictory\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"file\":\"spec.md:64-83\",\"evidence\":\"spec.md describes a planning-only phase and puts the move out of scope, while plan.md and implementation-summary.md state that the move executed in this folder and acceptance-criteria marks the packet complete.\",\"recommendation\":\"Reconcile authored scope, status, level and generated metadata to one current-state narrative.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"scopeProof\":\"Direct comparison of all canonical packet documents and implementation summary.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"packet status\",\"handoff state\",\"completion verification\"],\"content_hash\":\"review5-f005-packet-truth\"},{\"id\":\"F006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Inventory retains historical package-name recommendations without a clear current-state boundary\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"file\":\"scratch/inventory.md:274-298\",\"evidence\":\"The inventory recommends keeping @spec-kit/scripts and references scripts/package.json, while the current package manifest is @spec-kit/cli at runtime/cli/package.json.\",\"recommendation\":\"Label historical execution inputs explicitly or update the handoff companion document in a scoped documentation pass.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"scopeProof\":\"Direct comparison of inventory package-name section and current package manifest.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"execution planning\",\"package identity\",\"future replay\"],\"content_hash\":\"review5-f006-historical-package-name\"}],\"newFindingsRatio\":0.75,\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"summary\":{\"required\":2,\"executed\":4,\"pass\":1,\"partial\":2,\"fail\":1,\"blocked\":0,\"notApplicable\":0,\"gatingFailures\":1},\"results\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"pass\":0,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0},\"eviden