{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625491635,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ibD1m8qog7CK52LlF8O2gokb","state":{"status":"error","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-004.md\n+# Iteration 004: Maintainability, Documentation And Registry Surfaces\n+\n+## Focus\n+Review moved-package READMEs, script registry entries, catalog claims and operator-facing topology references.\n+\n+## Sources Reviewed\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/README.md:56-99,115-138,190-200`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README.md:15-25,55-77,94-110`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/README.md:16-39,69-99`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/config/README.md:12-49`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md:14-38,80-111`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/evals/README.md:17-45,81-107`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/resource-map/README.md:7-31`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/kpi/README.md:17-43,87-92`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/ops/README.md:13-28,68-74`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/sweep/README.md:10-30,34-46`\n+- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/scripts-registry.json:8-23,318-394`\n+\n+## Findings\n+### P1, Maintainability\n+- **F007**: Multiple persistent READMEs under `runtime/cli/` still call the moved package `scripts/` and retain retired topology links. Examples include `spec/README.md:17,58,72,105`, `tests/README.md:18,32,71`, `config/README.md:14,43-49`, `validation/README.md:16,105`, `resource-map/README.md:9,28`, `kpi/README.md:19-43,90`, `ops/README.md:15,72-74` and `evals/README.md:19,33`. These are current orientation and entrypoint documents, not historical changelog records.\n+\n+### P2, Maintainability\n+- **F008**: `scripts-registry.json:19,22,218,338-377,387-389` mixes current `runtime/cli` paths with stale package-internal dependency names such as `lib/embeddings.js`, `lib/anchor-generator.js`, `lib/content-filter.js` and output/category names using `memory`. The registry is a maintained discovery surface, so the mixed vocabulary can misdirect consumers even where the primary path is current.\n+\n+## Cross-Reference Results\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|---|---|---|---|---|\n+| spec_code | partial | hard | `runtime/cli/README.md:56-99`; `scripts-registry.json:8-23` | Current package topology is documented in the root README, but subordinate docs retain old names. |\n+| checklist_evidence | partial | hard | `acceptance-criteria.md:60-63`; `implementation-summary.md:136-155` | Current summary lists changed docs broadly but does not enumerate these stale subordinate pages. |\n+| feature_catalog_code | partial | advisory | `feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-folder-detection-and-description.md:44-54` | Catalog paths are mostly current, while implementation docs retain retired names. |\n+| playbook_capability | partial | advisory | `runtime/cli/tests/README.md:69-99` | Operator commands are current but surrounding topology statements are stale. |\n+\n+## Assessment\n+- New findings ratio: 0.70\n+- Dimensions addressed: maintainability, traceability\n+- Novelty justification: this pass expanded the stale-topology observation from isolated docs to the maintained registry and multiple current README surfaces.\n+\n+## Ruled Out\n+- Root CLI README's main topology: current at `README.md:58-98`.\n+- Historical changelog residue: not admitted because this pass only cites current runtime/cli docs and registry files.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Review generated source/dist alignment, runtime build boundaries, and test harness path assumptions.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n*** Add File: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"mode\":\"review\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"maintainability:documentation-and-registry\",\"dimensions\":[\"maintainability\",\"traceability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/config/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/evals/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/resource-map/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/kpi/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/ops/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/sweep/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/scripts-registry.json\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-folder-detection-and-description.md\"],\"findingsCount\":8,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":4,\"P2\":4},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":1},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Maintained CLI READMEs retain retired scripts topology\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"file\":\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README.md:17-18\",\"evidence\":\"Several current runtime/cli README files describe their own directories as scripts/* and link to retired memory paths, while the package root is runtime/cli and continuity is the current folder.\",\"recommendation\":\"Rewrite current subordinate README topology and links t