mpletion metadata.\n+- Rechecked all P1 evidence anchors used by the synthesis report.\n+- Did not run repository tooling, install, build, tests, validation or git writes.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Synthesis of the ten iteration files, deltas and evidence registry into the lineage report.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\nIndex: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":10,\"run\":10,\"mode\":\"review\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"maintainability:final-adversarial-coverage\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\",\"security\",\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\"spec.md\",\"plan.md\",\"tasks.md\",\"acceptance-criteria.md\",\"implementation-summary.md\",\"description.json\",\"graph-metadata.json\",\"deep-review-config.json\",\"deep-review-state.jsonl\",\"deep-review-findings-registry.json\",\"deep-review-strategy.md\",\"deep-review-dashboard.md\"],\"findingsCount\":18,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":8,\"P2\":10},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Packet scope and completion state remain contradictory\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"file\":\"spec.md:64-83\",\"evidence\":\"Planning-only scope conflicts with implementation-su