{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788625949123,"sessionID":"ses_f8da76375ffeCjuPpA01WdxIjC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_3poC7BL1vll7f9xNyiTgLK7S","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deep-review-strategy.md","offset":1,"limit":120},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/deep-review-strategy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Review Strategy\n3: description: Lineage-local review strategy for the scripts-to-runtime nesting packet.\n4: version: 1.11.0.13\n5: ---\n6: \n7: # Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n8: \n9: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n10: This strategy tracks ten inline passes. The requested `max-iterations` policy makes convergence telemetry only until iteration 10.\n11: \n12: ## 2. TOPIC\n13: Review of `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting` and its bounded implementation and packet evidence.\n14: \n15: ## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n16: - [x] correctness\n17: - [x] security\n18: - [x] traceability\n19: - [x] maintainability\n20: \n21: ## 4. NON-GOALS\n22: - No source, target spec, generated repository artifact, git state, branch or external service changes.\n23: - No repository validation, build, install or test command that can write outside this lineage.\n24: - No resource-map coverage gate because no resource map existed at initialization.\n25: \n26: ## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n27: Run all ten iterations. Convergence before iteration 10 is telemetry only. A pause, malformed state or write refusal would block the lineage.\n28: \n29: ## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n30: | Dimension | Verdict |